					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "01A1EC83A4A67CB7"
					item: "goety:pedestal"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "Performing Rituals"
			x: 1.5d
			y: 5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2E3C5A01C7C079C0"]
			description: [
				"&3Introduction —&r"
				""
				"The &bArca&r is obtained through a Forge Ritual. Players can &6retrieve their Rca&r by &esneaking and right-clicking it with an empty hand&r. &7(If you attempt to break it with bare hands or a pickaxe the Arca will not drop.)&r"
				""
				"The Arca has a maximum capacity of &2100000 Soul Energy&r. &7(You can inspect its status by sneaking.)&r"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&3Soul Energy Storage and Soul Hunger —&r"
				""
				"When the &bArca&r is placed, it becomes bound to the player. At the same time, the player &2can no longer use Soul Energy via Soul Totems, nor access internal soul storage directly&r."
				""
				"If there is no &2player-bound Soul Ark&r in the world, the player’s Soul Energy will not disappear; however, they will suffer from &cSoul Hunger&r."
				""
				"This effect gradually drains Soul Energy from the Arca, while also &ereducing the player’s movement and attack speed&r, and causing &ccontinuous damage&r."
				""
				"The effect cannot be removed unless &2Soul Energy is fully depleted&r or the player &2binds a Arca again&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&3Resurrection —&r"
				""
				"If your Arca contains more than &210000 Soul Energy&r, taking fatal damage will teleport you to the location of your &6last placed Arca&r. &7(Triggering this will consume Soul Energy equivalent to one full Totem of Souls.)&r"
			]
			icon: "goety:arca"
			id: "247AED1D908E67BD"
			rewards: [{
				count: 5
				id: "722266CF57F46934"
				item: "lightmanscurrency:coin_gold"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Soul Energy storing"
			tasks: [{
				id: "616E5BFB735D3F01"
				item: "goety:arca"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -0.75d
			y: 1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2C66968C7259F120"]
			description: [
				"&dCustom Brewing&r is a modded mechanic based on Witchery's brewing system, which is an interesting part of &dGoety&r. It allow you to craft &2a wide variety of potions&r, many of which have &eunique effects&r and &epowerful properties&r, making them extremely useful in both &2combat&r and &2daily gameplay&r."
				""
				"The &6guidebook&r can help players &2look up recipes&r."
				""
				"But that’s not all, the modpack also offers &2detailed step-by-step tutorials&r. By following the questline, you can fully master brewing."
			]
			id: "5ECDE24F7C16B68D"
			rewards: [{
				id: "12DA1087C8C729CC"
				item: "lightmanscurrency:coin_gold"
				type: "item"
