		}
		{
			dependencies: ["37315B135F29355E"]
			description: [
				"&7Please note, Focuses is not enhanced by the modpack’s magical damage bonuses. It is not considered true “magic” in that system.&r"
				""
				"With a stable source of soul energy, you can now begin experimenting with &6Focus&r."
				""
				"Unlike spells from &dIron’s Spells ’n Spellbooks&r, the Focuses consumes soul energy as a cost to cast. It includes many utility-based spells that play crucial roles in different scenarios."
