		{
			dependencies: ["537E1732782ABF04"]
			description: [
				"After reading the &6Forbidden Scroll&r, you can perform the &6Master Necroturgy Ritual&r, is required to craft the &6Potion of Transformation&r."
				""
				"Using the Potion of Transformatio allows you to grasp the knowledge of a Lich. Under the right conditions, the player can &2transform into a Lich&r."
				""
				"Becoming a Lich grants many advantages: permanent night vision, no need for hunger, immunity to drowning, and no longer being targeted by undead mobs."
				""
				"However, in exchange, you will suffer &cunending burning&r under sunlight."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"To evolve into a Lich, you must meet the following conditions:"
				""
				"1. Have a bound &6Arca&r."
				"2. The time must be a full moon night."
				"3. Drinking the Potion of Transformation will inflict 50 Wither damage. If you survive or revive after the fatal Wither damage, you will become a Lich."
			]
			id: "020F32F2C7347F32"
			rewards: [{
