		{
			dependencies: ["3CB4A421BFE6A3BC"]
			description: [
				"Brewing is divided into four stages:"
				""
				"&bCapacity  => Catalyst => Augmentation => Completion！&r"
				""
				"&bCapacity :&r Determines the &ecapacity&r of the potion being brewed. Effects, duration, and other augmentation all require &2capacity&r. &4Note: If the total cost exceeds the capacity during later stages, the brewing will fail.&r"
				""
				"&bCatalyst :&r Determines the &eeffects&r of the potion. Different effects consume different amounts of capacity, and you can &2combine multiple effects&r into a single potion."
				""
				"&bAugmentation :&r Modifies how the potion functions, including duration, area of effect, lingering, etc. &7(This step can be skipped.)&r"
				""
				"&bCompletion :&r If all steps are done correctly, you can use a &6Cauldron Ladle&r to &2right-click&r the &6Witch’s Cauldron&r, initiating soul energy infusion and producing the final potion."
			]
			icon: "goety:cauldron_ladle"
			id: "24119BB18C19CC04"
			rewards: [{
				count: 3
				id: "3EAACF4CB31588B9"
				item: "lightmanscurrency:coin_gold"
