			description: [
				"In the &2Swamp and Taiga biomes&r, you may come across a &3Blighted Shack&r. Inside, there will always be a &6Crystal Ball&r used to summon a &cCrone&r."
				""
				"Players can interact with the &6Crystal Ball&r to spawn a &ccrone&r. After summoning a crone, the Crystal Ball will enter a &2deactivated state&r and can no longer be used to summon crones."
				""
				"Inside a &3Blighted Shack&r, right-clicking a &2deactivated Crystal Ball&r with a &6Respawn Anchor&r will reactivate it, allowing you to &2challenge the boss again&r."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&cIf you choose to fight :&r The crone will always drop a &6Crone Hat&r upon death."
				""
				"&3If you choose to trade :&r The crone becomes &2neutral&r toward players wearing a &6Witch Robe&r and &6Witch Hat/Witch Hat variants&r, or a &6Warlock Robe&r, allowing you to &2trade&r with it."
