		{
			dependencies: ["2E3C5A01C7C079C0"]
			description: [
				"&7Once your research into the dark magic of illagers reaches a certain level, you will inevitably attract their attention. Unlike normal raids, an elite illager team will be dispatched specifically to eliminate those have stolen their magic.&r"
				""
				"When you possess &b2500 or more Soul Energy&r, an &4Illager Assault&r will has a chanceto occur."
				""
