				"The &dCustom Brewing System&r contains a wide variety of &2Capacites&r, &2Catalysts&r, and &2Augmentations&r, all of which can be found in the &6Guidebook&r."
				""
				"If you are unsure what potions you can brew, please use &2the Guidebook&r."
