			description: [
				"The &dGoety&r mod contains many Focus, which are the &2foundation of your spellcasting&r."
				""
				"Most Focus must be crafted through various magical rituals, though a small number can be crafted directly using the crafting table."
				""
				"Please refer to the &6The Black Book&r under the &e“Focuses” category&r for more details."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Once you obtain Focuses, hold the mod’s staff and press &2Z by default&r &7(to open the Focus slot interface)&r to access the staff’s &eFocus socket system&r and equip the Focuses you own."
				""
				"After that, simply &eright-click&r to cast spells."
