		{
			dependencies: ["236B608210F1F040"]
			description: [
				"When a Focus Bag is placed in the &eBelt slot&r or kept in the inventory, it can be used to open the player’s Focus storage. &7(Default key: C)&r"
				""
				"&7By default, the bag in the belt slot will be opened. If none is equipped there, the game will prioritize the leftmost pouch in the hotbar.&r"
				""
				"&7If none are found, it will attempt to open the bag closest to the top-left of the inventory.&r"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"When the player is &2holding any staff&r and has any &2Focus or Focus Bag&r in the inventory, they can open the &eFocus Circle&r. &7(Default key: X)&r"
				""
				"Holding the key will open the Focus Circle, and releasing it will close the interface."
				""
				"Within this interface, you can &2quickly adjust the staff’s Focus configuration&r and &2interact with Focus Bag&r."
				""
				"&7If the player has no Focus or Focus Bag, the Focus Circle cannot be opened.&r"
